---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/safe-rollback-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/safe-rollback-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={400}
  caption="Restore the backup only if the current file still matches what the installer wrote."
>
  With Codex closed, compare the current config file with the saved digest of
  the installed file. A match allows restoration of the backup. If the file
  has changed or the installed digest is missing, keep the current file and
  report the conflict.
</Diagram>
